  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Foreign Trade Management Support Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo a la Gestin del Comercio Exterior</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es incrementar el desempeo del comercio exterior de Ecuador. Para ello se fortalecer la capacidad tcnica e institucional del pas para:(i) formular e implementar polticas y acuerdos comerciales y de inversin;(ii) participar efectivamente en negociaciones comerciales; y (iii) incrementar y diversificar mercados y productos exportables, y atraer inversiones forneas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the program is to improve the international trade performance of Ecuador. In order to achieve this goal, the program will strengthen the country&apos;s technical and institutional capacity to: (i) formulate and implement trade and investment policies and agreements; (ii) participate effectively in trade negotiations; (iii) increase and diversify markets and exports and attract external investment.</narrative>
  </description>
